descriptions.job-0q2y3jp:
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;MptodQWymoZJoTxw95JlwRS2gxg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KDqBduzrNokmpsxHtx4lghoVgnc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kj2UdYHXroHA95xqSwYlzKKRg5d&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PT2idhyWOohNwnxyHiQl74U5geg&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxTZdwxNJoEfiZxGcS9lxXvwgPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PMpPdEpkHooxLcxMU9ill7weg3J&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MbuQdHwZGoGuHHxBFt7lu1O5gub&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PAbfdHUumoJRYsx4sFflqmKpgYd&quot;&gt;OKX runs a large peer-to-peer (P2P) crypto marketplace: an escrow-protected orderbook where users buy and sell crypto for local fiat through verified liquidity providers, with support for a wide range of local payment methods. The professional liquidity providers who post offers are what keep the marketplace deep and reliable.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FfzedqcJjoiUddxV3oSl5CMvgcA&quot;&gt;You will own the relationship with these key liquidity providers in various markets: supporting partners&#39; operational needs, maintaining marketplace depth and reliability, and improving partner experience. This is a builder&#39;s seat: high ownership, frontline, and fast-moving.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AWhBdiePYoqeXDxl5SOlzmr5g5f&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WS5gdZFZOoNFB1xqzKClJCdpgC2&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the P2P liquidity provider programme:&amp;nbsp;monitor marketplace depth and coverage, and improve partner satisfaction and retention&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XHvNdEUOToTvzUxFQKylipsFgUc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage the liquidity-provider programme, tiering frameworks, account management and retention\&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VWt1ddfBIoGg1Gx7Lhnl2gsrg7b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the growth strategy and retention funnel with data: build and read funnels, produce recurring analysis, and turn it into decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkyWdcYwmo8Lrnx54pdlC2s7gTh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to user quality and marketplace health, partnering with the user risk team on high-risk user profiling and dispute reduction. (Growth is the priority; risk exposure is a plus, not a requirement.)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NNyvdbKaIou7G8xDO20lzkIQgog&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VgpDdXbo1oCsAqx7hPSlzkYlgFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;7+ years in growth, account management or relationship management for high-value users or clients, including team leadership, with a track record of managing partner programmes at scale. Multi-market experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LgPUdoCmboGohtxX9kNl4YUYgEf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience managing high-volume client or partner relationships and improving partner engagement and service quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LfHYdGI9goz1lmxh5AelPEaMgjf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong data and funnel fluency: owns metrics, runs analysis, steers decisions from data.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEyad6yoAoezhLxnc12ljUFCgzh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;High-energy and genuinely hungry: gets on the frontline, has built something 0 to 1, and pushes into harder markets rather than safer ones.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V026d67pIoSZclxGEV4l3Kqqgqf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Backgrounds in payments, remittance or fintech are especially relevant. Crypto or digital-currency experience is a plus, not a requirement. Strong operators from large internet and marketplace companies are also welcome.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DL2fdzf6BoHXqZx2akClOccIgGb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Working proficiency in English. At least one of the two roles also requires working proficiency in Mandarin (liquidity-provider and stakeholder coverage across Greater China markets).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WOS2dwrNzodiOKxenKwlh0VrgTg&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QhxudR0p3o1wTbxOuHslncNCg9d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with fiat on-ramp / off-ramp, cross-border payments, or remittance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FJ1jdXDfcoNmCpxBs9ClkQEEgqe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exposure to emerging markets (Southeast Asia, Africa, LatAm, MENA).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HSDhd9kFvoTKZlxcwBQl1f2agEe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with user-segmentation, high-risk-user filtering, or trust and safety / fraud operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
