descriptions.job-16e4kmt:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;774&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;582&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Superintendent, CSA leads civil, structural, and architectural field execution for a new data center build - owning day-to-day site operations for this scope in a high-stakes, mission-critical environment. Reporting to the Construction Manager and Director, Construction, this role drives schedule, coordinates trades, and enforces safety and quality from mobilization through turnover. Superintendents are the standard on a Hut 8 site: what you walk past, you approve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of the key responsibilities you should expect are the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Civil &amp;amp; Sitework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supervise mass grading, excavation, underground utilities, stormwater systems, roadways, and site improvements. Coordinate survey control, earthwork QA/QC (compaction testing, proof rolls, subgrade acceptance), and dewatering operations. Sequence sitework deliberately to release foundations and vertical construction on schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural &amp;amp; Foundations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supervise deep and shallow foundations, structural concrete, tilt-wall or precast erection, and structural steel. Manage concrete placement plans, rebar and embed inspections, anchor bolt survey verification, and structural QC hold points with third-party special inspectors - embeds and anchor bolts placed wrong are the most expensive small mistakes on the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural &amp;amp; Envelope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive building envelope, roofing, exterior skin, doors and hardware, and interior architectural finishes. Own the water-tightness milestones that gate MEP rough-in and equipment set, and run finish and punch phases with discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Look-Ahead Planning &amp;amp; Trade Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the three-week look-ahead for CSA scopes: constraint identification, manpower loading review, and daily coordination with CSA subcontractors. Feed accurate progress to the Planner/Scheduler and escalate slippage with a recovery proposal, not just a report.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Quality Enforcement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enforce the site safety program for CSA work - excavation protection, crane and rigging operations, work at height, and concrete operations. Verify installed work against IFC drawings and specs, and hold trade partners to first-time quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Issue Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain daily reports, progress quantities, and photo documentation. Drive CSA RFIs and field issues to resolution with the Project Engineer (CSA) and the Civil/Structural Engineers, and capture as-built conditions as the work goes in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;774&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;582&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 7+ years of field supervision on heavy civil, structural concrete, or large industrial/commercial building projects; data center, semiconductor, or mission-critical experience strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Deep knowledge of earthwork operations, foundation systems, concrete placement, tilt-wall/precast erection, and structural steel - including QA/QC and special inspection requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Proven ability to sequence sitework and vertical construction to protect downstream MEP and equipment-set milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong command of three-week look-ahead planning, manpower review, and subcontractor coordination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Safety leadership on high-risk CSA work: excavation, cranes, and work at height; OSHA 30 preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Quality discipline on embeds, anchor bolts, and tolerances - the details that decide whether steel and equipment land.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Comfortable with construction management platforms (Procore, ACC, or similar) and full CSA drawing packages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Clear daily reporting and documentation habits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time site-based role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT MAKES HUT 8 A GREAT PLACE TO WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hut 8 offers a benefits and wellness program that includes medical, dental, vision, life, and&amp;nbsp;short-term and long-term disability insurance, as well as paid time off.&amp;nbsp;We are proud to invest in building the best team in the industry. At all levels of the organization,&amp;nbsp;we are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit, radical transparency, and relentless growth mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hut 8, you will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Work with bright, driven peers from a range of educational and professional backgrounds&amp;nbsp;including software development, energy, engineering, entrepreneurship, investment&amp;nbsp;banking, private equity, and management consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Design and pitch new products, services, and other initiatives to a leadership team&amp;nbsp;consisting of serial entrepreneurs and seasoned executives and backed by a board of&amp;nbsp;directors consisting of industry veterans of energy, finance, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Debate ideas and alternatives in a truly meritocratic setting where the learning curve is&amp;nbsp;steep and the lessons come from both senior and junior members of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Build a lifelong network of friends and professional connections at the cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;intersection of technology, energy, and infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-04ipmk5:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Manager to own Ripple&#39;s cross-border payment offering that enables global institutions to bridge stablecoins and fiat instantly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will lead the roadmap driving the next phase of growth for our flagship payouts products. They will use the power of digital assets and blockchain to bridge traditional financial infrastructure. You’ll partner closely with Engineering, Sales and Account Management, Risk/Fraud, Finance, Compliance, and Legal to build payment experiences that are customer-first, resilient, and built to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has deep payments expertise and a strong curiosity about digital assets. You&#39;re a problem solver; you work best when you&#39;re driving early stage solutions to achieve next-level scale. You&#39;ll excel working in a fast-past environment, and you are adept at and handling cross-functional initiatives across geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Strategy and Vision: Define and communicate a product vision, strategy and roadmap for our Global Payouts product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Quality and Delivery: Partner with engineering to ensure clear requirements, strong acceptance criteria, and high-quality launches..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payments Experience: Lead the end-to-end payments experience across Ripple payouts, crafting capabilities that balance customer experience, conversion, and regulatory controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional Leadership: Lead high-impact initiatives and align collaborators across Product, Engineering, Commercial, Finance, Legal, Compliance, Risk/Fraud, and Operations; remove blockers and drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborator Management and Influence: Deliver concise, committed communication to ensure alignment and drive outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12-15 years of total professional experience in financial services, fintech, or the crypto industry, with at least 5-10 years in a core product management role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for payments and a deep curiosity about digital assets and blockchain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of scaling and evangelizing successful products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex topics into clear, concise language for different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical competence and understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for establishing relationships and driving alignment across teams with different priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;For positions that will be based in CA, the annual salary range for this position is below. Actual salaries may vary based on numerous factors including, among other things, an individual applicant’s experience and qualifications for the position. This range does not include equity or additional compensation, such as bonuses or commissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA Annual Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$248,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$300,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1t1ealx:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team to drive financial insight and strategy at Stripe. The Finance &amp;amp; Strategy team brings understanding and predictability to Stripe’s financials, and we work together with our key business partners to accelerate long term growth for Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with F&amp;amp;S and Business Leaders to drive the long-term success of Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, mentor, and oversee a team of small analysts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally to identify important strategy questions and answer them with data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build financial forecasts and targets, track performance, and understand deviations from actuals to drive strategy and operational rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain deep knowledge and understanding of Stripe&#39;s business performance across geographies and user segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define metrics and leading indicators of business performance and partner with the Analytics team to develop tools and dashboards to make these metrics widely accessible across Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant FP&amp;amp;A, strategic finance, or business-finance experience with 2+ years managing a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning planning and forecasting processes across headcount, operating expenses, and/or revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial-analysis fundamentals, including budgeting and forecasting, month-end close support, and budget-versus-actual variance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage and develop a small team of analysts, including setting priorities, reviewing work, coaching, and creating clear accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to retain a defined individual-contributor portfolio alongside people-management responsibilities. ~50% IC work, 50% Manager responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and/or Python skills, with demonstrated ability to automate recurring analyses and improve finance workflows through AI-enabled tools and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to structure ambiguous problems, independently develop a point of view, and drive cross-functional projects to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder-management and communication skills, with a track record of acting as a trusted, objective finance partner to business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working effectively across regions, time zones, and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience in a strategic finance function at a high-growth tech company, preferably in the payments/fintech space&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of SQL or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-07heiph:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;DV Trading is seeking an experienced, high-performing trader to deploy and scale profitable strategies on a best-in-class proprietary platform. This role is designed for individuals with a demonstrated ability to generate alpha who are looking for greater autonomy, access to capital, and a high-performance environment without the constraints of traditional institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform supports a wide range of experience levels—from highly established traders who operate independently end-to-end, to developing traders who may benefit from support in areas such as research, technology, or execution. Resources across quant research, engineering, and infrastructure are available to help accelerate strategy development and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently manage and scale a proprietary trading strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, refine, and optimize models, signals, and execution frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of risk, positioning, and P&amp;amp;L&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage DV’s technology, infrastructure, and support to expand your book&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with traders, quants, and engineers to enhance strategy performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2+ years of experience at a proprietary trading firm, hedge fund, or bank&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated, consistently profitable trading strategy (all asset classes considered)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of live performance (beyond backtesting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong return on capital (ROC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or leading successful trading teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively across functions, including leadership, risk, compliance, engineering, and legal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-17df99x:
&lt;h2&gt;About Ondo&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capital markets are moving onchain. Ondo Finance is building the products and infrastructure that will bring them there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create institutional-grade, blockchain-enabled investment products and services, including tokenized treasuries, tokenized stocks and ETFs, and new trading experiences built for global, always-on markets. We are the category leader by AUM, well-capitalized, and backed by investors including Founders Fund, Coinbase Ventures, Pantera Capital, and Tiger Global.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The underlying financial infrastructure is complex. We believe the product experience should not be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Web team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Web team builds the product layer that makes Ondo&#39;s financial infrastructure accessible. We own the experiences through which users onboard, establish eligibility, move money, mint and redeem Ondo Stocks, manage portfolios, and use products across multiple blockchains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a small team of exceptional engineers with broad ownership and a high bar for craft, judgment, and execution. We turn complexity across compliance systems, backend services, smart contracts, and external partners into products that feel clear and dependable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering on this team is distinguished by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product taste.&lt;/strong&gt; We simplify complex financial workflows without hiding the details that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers shape, build, launch, and improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed with confidence.&lt;/strong&gt; We scope sharply, move quickly, and hold a high quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and correctness.&lt;/strong&gt; Access control, auditability, privacy, and failure behavior are design constraints from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency and low ego.&lt;/strong&gt; We act without waiting, invite direct critique, and make the team better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Full-Stack Engineer focused on Growth, you will design the foundations of how users discover, understand, adopt, and return to Ondo&#39;s products. You will own the systems and product experiences that turn user insight into measurable growth across acquisition, activation, engagement, and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your scope spans the full growth loop—from public websites and user-facing product journeys to experimentation, analytics, content systems, backend workflows, and third-party platforms. You will set technical direction, define the measurement foundations, and evolve these systems as our products, markets, and scale change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a foundational ownership role for a senior engineer. You will turn ambiguous growth opportunities into clear hypotheses, durable architecture, and polished product experiences. You will partner closely with Product, Design, Marketing, Data, and Engineering while owning the judgment: where friction matters, what to build, how to measure it, and when the evidence calls for a different direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is not experiment volume. It is to understand users better than anyone else and turn that understanding into durable product improvements and measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the growth engineering strategy across discovery, acquisition, activation, engagement, and retention—from identifying the highest-leverage opportunities through technical design, launch, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve the foundations for experimentation, event instrumentation, attribution, funnel analysis, content, and lifecycle experiences so the team can move quickly and trust what it learns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build polished user-facing experiences and the backend systems, data models, APIs, webhooks, and third-party integrations behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with users and product data to identify friction, form clear hypotheses, and make disciplined product and technical bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn validated learning into durable product capabilities and measurable business impact—not one-off experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, Marketing, and Data to lead launches, localization, and new ways to grow adoption across Ondo&#39;s products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve organic discovery and conversion through technical SEO and AEO, performance, structured content, and clear user journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the level of the team through clear writing, thoughtful code review, strong operational ownership, and effective use of modern AI engineering tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience building and operating production full-stack applications with React, Next.js, and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving measurable acquisition, activation, engagement, or retention outcomes through growth engineering, product-led growth, consumer product, ecommerce, or similarly data-informed product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating serverless systems on AWS, including Lambda and adjacent services such as API Gateway, EventBridge, or SQS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience using BigQuery and product analytics data to model funnels, investigate user behavior, and measure product and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fundamentals in API and data-model design, relational databases, event-driven systems, event instrumentation, experimentation, testing, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of owning product work end to end—not only implementing experiments or specifications handed to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product taste: you can find the simplest experience that solves the user&#39;s problem without ignoring the complexity or edge cases underneath it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data fluency and intellectual honesty. You can define useful metrics, distinguish signal from noise, and change direction when the evidence challenges your hypothesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to communicate clearly, learn unfamiliar domains quickly, and create alignment across engineering, product, design, marketing, and data partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency and low ego. You move important work forward, invite strong critique, and care more about the outcome than whose idea wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building fintech, trading, crypto-native, or other high-consideration products where earning user trust is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lifecycle marketing, CRM, CMS, experimentation, localization, or analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AEO, structured content, international SEO, and growth across multiple regions or languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI to prototyping, personalization, analytics, content operations, or other growth workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do not expect every strong candidate to arrive with deep crypto or every growth specialty listed above. We do expect curiosity, strong product and engineering fundamentals, and the ability to turn learning into shipped improvements quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work helping define how a global audience discovers and adopts a new category of financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation including salary, future token rights, and/or equity, according to your preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full medical, vision, and dental benefits, plus a flexible vacation policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first environment with meaningful autonomy and influence over product and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional colleagues from Goldman Sachs, BlackRock, Two Sigma, Bridgewater, SpaceX, AWS, Meta, Google, McKinsey, Coinbase, Circle, and Uniswap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backing from leading crypto experts and investors, including Pantera Capital, Founders Fund, and Coinbase Ventures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

descriptions.job-11xblf9:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Commercial Sales team is responsible for the acquisition, growth, retention, and expansion of mid-market customers. As a Grower Account Executive, you’ll set strategy for your territory, identify opportunities for existing customers to get the most out of Stripe, execute scaled sales strategies to grow revenue and drive end-to-end campaigns to nurture relationships and increase adoption of Stripe products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, Commercial Grower you will play an instrumental role in fueling Stripe’s growth and expanding revenue from Stripe’s existing mid-market customers. In this role, you will also help build out a new team touching more of our install base and GTM motion at Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate upsell opportunities to drive revenue growth in your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement sales strategies to grow revenue per user, adopt new products and ensure retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and understand users’ pain points to propose Stripe solutions and own the full sales cycle, from business case development to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own contract renewals and lead commercial negotiations to increase and retain existing customer revenue and increase Stripe share of wallet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to solve user pain points and improve Stripe’s product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be required to work from the Chicago office three (3) days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5+ years full sales cycle/closing experience with existing business accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand technical requirements and craft solutions across multiple technology&amp;nbsp; products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform quantitative analysis and independently manage pricing negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational acumen and ability to manage and prioritize a book of 100 accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and motivation to operate in a highly ambiguous and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be required to work from the Chicago office three (3) days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a sales and/or customer-facing role at a high growth payments company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

