&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;So for those willing to commit, adapt and pioneer the most important change of the century we offer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
